(7566908, 1213928, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge		<br/> <br/>Big he certainly is! B is also for Brave for getting so close! Another great image Janine, I like the low profile and your choice of diagonal for the composition it works well. The eyes are nice and sharp, crucial for any portrait.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge		 Big he certainly is! B is also for Brave for getting so close! Another great image Janine, I like the low profile and your choice of diagonal for the composition it works well. The eyes are nice and sharp, crucial for any portrait.', '2018-04-24 14:30:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7566909, 1213911, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge		<br/> <br/>A great find, nice one Harrison! I love the triangle of the three faces, he really has had a profound effect on them. I do think you could have increased the impact with more careful closer cropping, the door and chair should have been omitted with top and sides cropping. That aside, congratulations on the high score and placement for this amusing find</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge		 A great find, nice one Harrison! I love the triangle of the three faces, he really has had a profound effect on them. I do think you could have increased the impact with more careful closer cropping, the door and chair should have been omitted with top and sides cropping. That aside, congratulations on the high score and placement for this amusing find', '2018-04-24 14:36:05.000000', NULL, 0),
